<title>USA: FGIC qualifies seven issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies seven issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said it has qualified for bond insurance the following seven municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Lincoln County, N.C., $3.1 million general obligation school bonds.</p>
<p>--Delhi, N.Y., Central School District, $7.65 million.</p>
<p>--Pearl River, N.Y., Unified School District, $6.5 million.</p>
<p>--El Paso, Texas, $22.375 million GOs.</p>
<p>--El Paso, Texas, $8.4 million Public Property Financing bonds.</p>
<p>--El Paso, Texas, $7.2 million Tax and Revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Sun Prairie, Wis., $4.225 million GOs.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
